{%- comment -%}
  seo-schema.liquid
  Version:      1.3.1
  Last updated: 2026-08-15
  Router: renders the correct JSON-LD structured data snippet
  based on the current page template.

  Changes:
    - v1.3.0: removed duplicate lb-seo-schema.liquid render on index.
      lb-schema-sitesearch already emits the identical WebSite +
      SearchAction JSON-LD; having both produced duplicate structured
      data on the homepage. lb-seo-schema.liquid deleted from theme.
    - v1.2.0: removed extended_schemas_deployed deploy-gate flag.
      All referenced snippet files are present in the theme; the flag
      was a foot-gun (a partial sync would 500 the storefront). If a
      future snippet is added under a deploy gate, guard it inline at
      the render site with `{%- if snippets contains ... -%}` semantics
      or a per-snippet feature flag — do not reintroduce a global bool.
    - v1.1.1: lb-schema-videoobject wired into product template.
    - lb-schema-organization is homepage-only (redundant elsewhere).
    - lb-schema-sitesearch fires on index; lb-schema-faqpage on product.
    - lb-schema-itemlist is intentionally NOT rendered on collection —
      lb-schema-collection already emits an ItemList as its mainEntity;
      a second one produced duplicate structured data (May 2026 audit).
    - v1.3.1: added BreadcrumbList to collection template (2026-08-15).
      Product and article both had one; collection was the gap.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- case template.name -%}
  {%- when 'product' -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-product', product: product -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-breadcrumb', product: product -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-faqpage', product: product -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-videoobject', product: product -%}
  {%- when 'collection' -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-collection', collection: collection -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-breadcrumb', collection: collection -%}
  {%- when 'article' -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-article', article: article -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-breadcrumb', article: article -%}
  {%- when 'index' -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-organization' -%}
    {%- render 'lb-schema-sitesearch' -%}
{%- endcase -%}
